{"id":"b3","level":3,"levelName":"Ulpan Bet","n":3,"of":22,"title":"Prepositions that decline","titleHe":"נְטִיַּת מִלּוֹת יַחַס","goal":"Attach pronoun endings to לְ, בְּ and עִם.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"Hebrew doesn't say to me — it says the preposition with an ending fused on. You've already used לִי; the others follow the same pattern."},{"type":"table","caption":"Three prepositions, declined","head":["","לְ — to","בְּ — in","עִם — with"],"rows":[["me","לִי","בִּי","אִתִּי"],["you (m.)","לְךָ","בְּךָ","אִתְּךָ"],["you (f.)","לָךְ","בָּךְ","אִתָּךְ"],["him","לוֹ","בּוֹ","אִתּוֹ"],["her","לָהּ","בָּהּ","אִתָּהּ"],["us","לָנוּ","בָּנוּ","אִתָּנוּ"],["them","לָהֶם","בָּהֶם","אִתָּם"]]},{"type":"tip","body":"עִם is irregular: its declined forms are built on אֶת־, giving אִתִּי rather than עִמִּי. עִמִּי exists, but it's literary."}],"vocab":[{"he":"לִי","en":"to me","translit":"li"},{"he":"לוֹ","en":"to him","translit":"lo"},{"he":"לָהּ","en":"to her","translit":"la"},{"he":"אִתִּי","en":"with me","translit":"iti"},{"he":"אִתּוֹ","en":"with him","translit":"ito"},{"he":"עָלַי","en":"on me, about me","translit":"alai"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["welcome (to a woman)","to me","a picture","length"],"correct":1,"prompt":"לִי","translit":"li"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["reality","to him","roof","is located, is found"],"correct":1,"prompt":"לוֹ","translit":"lo"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["to her","clean","sand","books"],"correct":0,"prompt":"לָהּ","translit":"la"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["worker, labourer","ready, prepared","value, worth","with me"],"correct":3,"prompt":"אִתִּי","translit":"iti"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["new","specifically, of all things","night","with him"],"correct":3,"prompt":"אִתּוֹ","translit":"ito"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["opposes","a note, a remark","water","on me, about me"],"correct":3,"prompt":"עָלַי","translit":"alai"},{"type":"match","pairs":[["לִי","to me"],["לוֹ","to him"],["לָהּ","to her"],["אִתִּי","with me"],["אִתּוֹ","with him"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “with me”?","options":["שׁוֹפֵט","בָּטוּחַ","אִתִּי","הוֹאִיל וְ"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “on me, about me”?","options":["עָלַי","מַהֵר","מִמֶּנִּי","טַעֲנָה"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["לוֹ","לִי","עָלַי","לָהּ"],"correct":3,"say":"לָהּ","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “to her”?","options":["אָחוֹת","זְכוּת","שִׁיר","לָהּ"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"לִי","translit":"li","en":"to me"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “to him”?","options":["לוֹ","כְּגוֹן","מַעֲרָב","גָּדוֹל"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"“With her” is —","options":["אִתָּהּ","עִמָּהּ בְּ","לָהּ","בָּהּ"],"correct":0,"why":"עִם declines on the stem אִת־. לָהּ is to her, בָּהּ is in her."},{"type":"type","q":"Write “to me” in Hebrew","answer":"לִי","hint":"li"}]}